dulifera","fi":"Jättipalsami","group":"Plantae","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/1204644/medium.","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/1204644/square.","attribution":"(c) John Barkla, some rights reserved (CC BY), uploaded by John Barkla","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jättipalsami","summary":"<b>Jättipalsami</b> (<i>Impatiens glandulifera</i>) on suurikokoinen, yksivuotinen ja hyvin kilpailukykyinen palsamikasvi. Laji on kotoisin Himalajalta, mutta se on levinnyt puutarhakarkulaisena laajoille alueille vieraslajiksi muun muassa Suomessa.","spread":65893,"m":[1,0,0,0,0,4,35,38,2,2,0,0],"s":[[66.5025,25.69713],[66.50254,25.69712],[66.50037,25.69356],[65.78848,24.51241],[65.77678,24.56253],[66.48228,25.69046],[66.50259,25.68535],[65.92216,26.51581],[65.80942,24.53132],[65.80963,24.5331],[66.50046,25.69357],[65.92162,26.50774],[66.70689,27.43968],[66.5026,25.6856],[66.51586,25.70957],[66.50411,25.68675],[66.48043,25.68839],[65.91966,27.98675],[65.92055,27.98585],[66.05135,28.49072],[66.48395,25.81471],[66.51108,25.67122],[66.51023,25.67005],[66.47499,25.76967],[65.98766,27.28591],[65.77903,24.4872],[66.50537,25.6767],[66.51408,25.65848],[65.81433,24.54042],[65.78963,24.50638],[65.64565,25.04497],[65.8048,24.53935],[65.80512,24.5393],[65.97178,24.05656],[65.80519,24.53922],[65.85745,24.17023],[66.90574,26.20556],[65.78152,24.48732],[65.78544,24.50878],[66.50408,25.68539],[66.69138,27.43027],[66.4258,25.45968],[66.31139,23.67782],[65.85875,24.17289],[65.85894,24.175],[65.86037,24.17385],[66.70543,27.44023],[65.8628,24.17608],[65.86232,24.17343],[65.85966,24.14834],[65.80617,24.55065],[65.80579,24.5506],[65.80528,24.55035],[65.80085,24.55162],[66.71392,27.38808],[66.50717,25.64565],[66.30764,23.66294],[65.82546,24.19503]]},{"id":496214,"sci":"Selatosomus aeneus","fi":"Metalliseppä","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/89897468/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/89897468/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Benjamin Gorfer, all rights reserved, uploaded by Benjamin Gorfer","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metalliseppä","summary":"<b>Metalliseppä</b> (<i>Selatosomus aeneus</i>) on Suomessa yleinen kovakuoriainen. Se voi hohtaa sinisenä, vihreänä tai kuparinvärisenä. Lajin etuselkä on hieno- ja tiheäpisteinen ja peitinsiivet pitkittäisharjuiset. Metallisepän jalat ovat punaruskeat. Metalliseppä viihtyy aurinkoisilla ja kuivilla paikoilla ja sitä voi tavata alku- ja keskikesällä. Laji on melko kookas kovakuoriainen ollen kooltaan aikuisena 10–16 mm. Metalliseppiä esiintyy Suomessa lähes koko maassa aivan pohjoisinta Lappia lukuun ottamatta. Laajemmin lajia esiintyy lähinnä Euroopan alueella.","spread":66685,"m":[0,0,0,0,11,16,4,1,0,0,0,0],"s":[[66.89807,27.46645],[66.36108,23.89944],[65.64793,25.14877],[66.132,24.86657],[66.30543,23.66973],[66.30519,23.67045],[66.30542,23.67007],[66.47625,25.74181]]},{"id":83653,"sci":"Rosa rugosa","fi":"Kurtturuusu","group":"Plantae","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/394868328/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/394868328/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Emily, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Emily","wiki":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosa_rugosa","summary":"","spread":78146,"m":[0,0,0,1,0,12,14,10,2,2,0,0],"s":[[66.52383,25.70806],[66.49664,25.68766],[66.5024,25.7457],[66.49447,25.75621],[66.51091,25.70339],[66.50187,25.74613],[66.50245,25.74679],[66.49499,25.75638],[65.60509,24.1932],[66.50237,25.74728],[65.81268,24.53292],[65.78016,24.49111],[66.54214,28.60265],[65.81485,24.54385],[65.85098,24.16538],[66.50162,25.75126],[66.50156,25.74803],[66.50538,25.72976],[65.78178,24.48916],[65.78242,24.49118],[65.7981,24.54995],[65.80652,24.5238],[65.8128,24.53309],[65.81303,24.53023],[65.81348,24.52927],[65.81342,24.52954],[65.81282,24.53556],[65.81432,24.54024],[65.80109,24.54673],[68.65944,27.53944],[6